#: manifest.json
#, x-machine
msgid ""
"A ten-band equalizer with presets, audio sync, normalize and crystalizer, channel selection, plus audio track switching, loading external audio files and choosing the output device.\n"
"Settings are kept across files and restarts; everything is in the Audio panel beside the video (Audio…, Alt+2), the tracks also under Audio Track in the right-click menu."
msgstr ""
"带预设的十段均衡器、声音同步、规格化与晶化、声道选择，以及音轨切换、载入外部音频文件和输出设备选择。\n"
"设置跨文件、跨重启保留；全部在视频旁的「声音」面板（声音…，Alt+2），音轨也在右键菜单「音轨」中。"

